The `PUT_SetContract` method contains the logic to test the `ArrayList`'s contract when it is modified using the indexer set operation. It assumes that the `ArrayList` under test is passed in the `arrList` parameter, the new value to be set at the specified `index` is supplied in the `x` parameter.

To observe the state before and after the modification using `PexObserve.ValueForViewing`, the value of various properties are captured. These properties include the count of the `ArrayList`, the index of `x` in the `ArrayList`, the last index of `x` in the `ArrayList`, and whether the `ArrayList` contains `x`.

